Work: "PANNs: Large-Scale Pretrained Audio Neural Networks for Audio Pattern Recognition (Pretrained Models)", by Qiuqiang Kong,
Yin Cao, Turab Iqbal, Yuxuan Wang, Wenwu Wang and Mark D. Plumbley, Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.3987831. Paper: Q. Kong et al.,
"PANNs: Large-Scale Pretrained Audio Neural Networks for Audio Pattern Recognition", IEEE/ACM Transactions on Audio, Speech, and
Language Processing 28 (2020), 2880-2894.

What is used: the file Cnn14_mAP=0.431.pth, unmodified, downloaded at run time by tools/vocal_activity.py (pinned sha256
